{"title":"What should I ask Ross Douthat?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/910597754/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Ross-Douthat.html","date":1736277150000,"content":"<p>Ross has a new (and very good) book coming out <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Believe-Why-Everyone-Should-Religious/dp/0310367581/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1A1LUKW6F589J&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.lyuAduLYtWgFOy9PLbP3oE5gFwo1Ltg0D4Hj8h6wSVWjPVd-y4Fr-IUoDXpUKI51MCBhN5mejhFkoyDF1Nwhs0kqJBdCI_pJgKRoGRC4CPKcdeuEe4gtFa3Atcs4I9RZ2m5LGUlk6B6c0SjF-NXBB80q6LmB5jrd0hJaDR3UjmkVYdqJWbQrNDC6_YbwwFvg.XsVf35mdceCu9JKlomjyBEoNe3SZCggzCEmyEB1UB5g&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=ross+douthat+believe&amp;qid=1736275872&amp;sprefix=ross+douthat%2Caps%2C89&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Believe: Why Everyone Should be Religious</a>.  I will be doing a Conversation with him, mostly about the book although not entirely.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://conversationswithtyler.com/episodes/ross-douthat/\" target=\"_blank\">my first</a> and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://conversationswithtyler.com/episodes/ross-douthat-2/\" target=\"_blank\">second</a> Conversation with Ross.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2017/07/ross-douthat-whether-believe-god.html\" target=\"_blank\">my earlier exchange</a> with Ross about belief in God, scroll back through the links.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/what-should-i-ask-ross-douthat-2.html\">What should I ask Ross Douthat?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"htt